# Supabase MCP

Use for: table design, migrations, indexes, SQL debugging, persistence adapter work.

Before schema changes: inspect existing tables. For production issues: logs/advisors before editing schema.

Local-first NovelGuard may not use Supabase for all features — confirm in code before assuming DB path.
